{"id": "ho-t04", "category": "ho_target", "query": "双十一那种节假日下单，发货时间会变吗？变多久？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "glm-5.3", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t04-e16426", "answer": "您好！根据店铺政策：\n\n- **现货商品**：正常是付款后 48 小时内发货，但**节假日（含双十一等大促）会顺延**，具体顺延多久政策没有固定天数，以实际安排为准。\n- **预售商品**：以商品页标注的发货时间为准，大促期间建议以下单页面显示的预计发货时间为准。\n\n如果您想了解某次大促的具体发货安排，可以看商品页的标注，或联系人工客服确认。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2026, "output_tokens": 136, "total_tokens": 2162, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 9853.7, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t05", "category": "ho_target", "query": "单子发出来了，一般几个小时内能在物流页看到揽收记录？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "glm-5.3", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t05-eec8ca", "answer": "发货后物流单号会同步到订单页面，通常 **24 小时内**就能在物流页查到揽收记录。\n\n如果超过 24 小时还没看到，多半是物流方更新延迟，建议稍后刷新再看；若长时间仍无更新，可以提供订单号进一步核实。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 1978, "output_tokens": 97, "total_tokens": 2075, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 17661.3, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
